        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7812, 3 Inch Center to Center Cabinet Pull Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 7 finishes, this cabinet pull rose is the perfect accouterment to any traditional home. Its timelessness comes from the classic design. It is suitable for use with most cabinet pulls with 3 inch center to centers such as the <a href=\"/products/twist-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-800\">Twist Cabinet Pull</a> or the <a href=\"/products/simple-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-16\">Simple Cabinet Pull</a>. The Plain Rectangular Cabinet Pull Backplate is an easy way to add elegance to a space.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7812, Plain Cabinet Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/nrp.jpg?v=1704442257\" width=\"599\" height=\"127\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
